#: legacyrandrscreen.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Your screen orientation, size and refresh rate have been changed to the "
"requested settings. Please indicate whether you wish to keep this "
"configuration. In 15 seconds the display will revert to your previous "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Du hest de Grött, Bild-Wedderhalen un Utrichten vun Dien Schirm ännert. "
"Bitte giff an, wat Du de niegen Instellen övernehmen wullt. In 15 Sekunnen "
"warrt de Schirm op de olen Weerten torüchsett."

